    "description": "Conditional terminology suggestions, separated into equivalent, style_preference and related_concepts. Co-occurrence is not proof of inconsistency.",
    "usage": "Resolve scripts/terminology_checker.py from the installed Skill root; input paths are relative to the caller. --map replaces this map.",
    "priority": "Author-confirmed definitions and usage > selected glossary > bundled style suggestion. Set author_confirmed=true and preferred to a configured variant, or relation=related_concepts with definitions.",
