      "equivalent": "Conditionally the same concept; review consistency without automatic replacement.",
      "style_preference": "Optional wording preference, not a scientific correction.",
      "related_concepts": "Potentially different concepts; preserve distinctions, do not normalize."
    },
    "legacy_maps": "Missing relation remains supported as style_preference; required legacy fields are validated.",
    "english_matching": "Optional variants_en list; case-insensitive whole Latin-token matching by default. Set case_sensitive=true for capitalization comparisons. No inflection or semantic matching."
